 source←GetSourceFolder folder;cfg;ns
⍝ Returns the source folder of the Cider project in `folder`, relative to `folder` and with a
⍝ trailing separator, or an empty vector in case it cannot be established.\\
⍝ Example: for this very project the result is `APLSource/`.
 source←''
 :If F.IsFile folder,'/cider.config'
     cfg←⊃F.NGET folder,'/cider.config'
     ns←⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')⊣cfg
 :AndIf 9=ns.⎕NC'CIDER'
 :AndIf 2=ns.CIDER.⎕NC'source'
 :AndIf 0<≢ns.CIDER.source
 :AndIf F.IsDir folder,'/',ns.CIDER.source
     source←F.EnforceSlash{⍵,'/'/⍨~'/\'∊⍨¯1↑⍵}ns.CIDER.source
 :EndIf
⍝Done
